WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:06.564
Everyone has a job title and a manager in Worklynq, and the org chart puts the whole company together.

2
00:00:07.633 --> 00:00:11.217
In User Management, each person’s title shows under their name.

3
00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:16.552
To set someone’s title and manager, open the menu on their row, and click Edit user.

4
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.208
Type a title, and search for their manager. It never offers the person, or anyone who reports to them.

5
00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:27.699
People can fill in their own, too, in their profile, under Personal Info.

6
00:00:28.667 --> 00:00:35.024
The org chart shows everyone, nested under who they report to, with how many people report to each person.

7
00:00:35.467 --> 00:00:41.205
Search by name, title or department. No manager set lists anyone who isn’t placed yet.

8
00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:50.392
Everyone can see it in their profile, under Org chart. And when someone is deleted, the people who reported to them move up to that person’s manager.

9
00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:59.111
One more thing in Personal Info: anyone can turn off notification emails. Sign-in codes and invitations always come through.

